[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3707161232","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114564#issuecomment-3707161232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114564","id":3707161232,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c9sqQ","user":{"login":"RuthgerD","id":57626200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjI2MjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57626200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD","html_url":"https://github.com/RuthgerD","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-03T16:08:15Z","updated_at":"2026-01-03T16:08:15Z","body":"I will make a MRP, but it's pretty clear the find_nearest_point is not robust against weird cases","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3707161232/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3707177616","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114564#issuecomment-3707177616","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114564","id":3707177616,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c9wqQ","user":{"login":"RuthgerD","id":57626200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3NjI2MjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/57626200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD","html_url":"https://github.com/RuthgerD","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RuthgerD/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-03T16:32:21Z","updated_at":"2026-01-03T16:32:36Z","body":"Okay regrettably I don't have time to make a MRP, as it seems quite tricky to reproduce it. \n\nto give a rough idea of my setup:\n```\nnode3d\n - path_3d (top level = true)\n - armature / skeleton / spline_ik_3d\n```\nwhen I spawn the scene in a big world and set the position to far away from 0,0,0 it seems to trigger the bug.\n\nbut if I set the path_3d to the spawn point it does not lock up, so it might be related to the distance of the path3d to the actual skeleton.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3707177616/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3707455291","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114564#issuecomment-3707455291","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114564","id":3707455291,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7c-0c7","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-03T23:49:52Z","updated_at":"2026-01-03T23:49:52Z","body":"An MRP which reproduce the hang must be required.\n\nFYI, the iteration of the search loop changes depending on whether the path is closed.\n\nIt is natural that the distance of the Skeleton is relevant since point search depends on the bone position, but we need to identify under which conditions an infinite loop occurs.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3707455291/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3707917464","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114564#issuecomment-3707917464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/