.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-29T10:46:15Z","updated_at":"2026-03-29T10:53:14Z","body":"Although an infinite loop does not occur within `find_nearest_point`, I have confirmed that an infinite loop occurs outside of it. This depends on the length of the chain and the distance to the first point.\n\n<img width=\"357\" height=\"274\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/103fdf5a-e3c9-47dc-8166-f0d1705aa23d\" />\n\n[splinetest.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26330454/splinetest.zip)\n\nIt will be fixed in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117959.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4149891176/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]